    "x1": 8160,
    "z1": 17340
   },
   "text": "A lamp's burning in there. There's a smear on the glass."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 22100,
    "z0": 10200,
    "x1": 26180,
    "z1": 11900
   },
   "text": "A dog, drowned against the log. A Doberman.\nIts coat's come away in patches. It has a collar tag: SPENCER KENNELS."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 11220,
    "z0": 22780,
    "x1": 13940,
    "z1": 23800
   },
   "text": "Washing on the line. One shirt is stiff with blood."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 17340,
    "z0": 16150,
    "x1": 20060,
    "z1": 18020
   },
   "text": "An adder, cut in two. A spade beside it."
  },
  {
